// Upper median of the winning labeled hammings.
// Even counts keep the larger of the two central values.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE hmup ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG hmup rank

IMPULSE hmup 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "hmup" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
